# Local artifact library

## Quick open

- [Labs, sandboxes and capability capsules](../Designs/Labs%20and%20Capability%20Capsules.md) — current high-level design and diagram.
- [Deck Catalog](../Presentation%20Library/Deck%20Catalog.md) — current presentation entrypoints and prior decks.
- [PRD/design reference packages and build sources](#reference-packages-and-build-sources) — dated local source bundles; owner scope is shown beside each.

Actual files are inside this vault. The [manifest](artifact-manifest.json) records original paths, SHA-256, dispositions and bounded format checks. Reused archived originals remain byte-for-byte unchanged. These are source artifacts and dated reference copies; product/design authority stays with the owning repository.

Indexed **415 source artifact paths** (232 unique file hashes), with **1364 supporting files** in 13 portable source packages. Source aliases can point to the same local file.

## Decks and reports

See the [Deck Catalog](../Presentation%20Library/Deck%20Catalog.md) for editable presentations, reports and available embedded speaker notes.

## Reference packages and build sources

Extract packages to an empty directory to retain their internal relative paths. Presentation dependencies and references outside each package are not vendored. XML/ZIP readability is not a successful build. PRD/design bundles are dated, branch-local reference snapshots, not competing maintained copies.

