## Limits and unavailable items

Unavailable expected paths at this collection: `AI4Research-Notebook/Designs/Paper2Agent Briefing/presentation/Paper2Agent Talk rev9.pptx`, `AI4Research-Notebook/Designs/Paper2Agent Briefing/presentation/review-rev9`.

Structural checks cover ZIP CRC/core XML, PDF signatures and UTF-8 readability where applicable. No slides or pages were rendered, code executed, scientific claims verified, or malware certification performed.

Source Markdown inside ZIPs preserves its original syntax; links outside each package can require its original repository. Binary attachments are excluded by Git and need the documented vault backup. The manifest records the exact source and destination for every selected artifact; source-unavailable entries and format failures remain explicit. Third-party skill templates, caches, dependency trees, private state and entire source repositories are excluded.
